          "snippet": {
            "line": 614,
            "text": "theorem mean_tangentCovariance_eq_leading (B N0 : ℕ) {n : ℕ}\n    (hn : (choice B N0).prepared.N + 1 ≤ n) {x : Point}\n    (hx : x ∈ (BaseContextAssembly.nativeStrip nominal standardRegion).domain) (i : Fin 2) :\n    StateMomentBalances.meanBar (tangentCovariance B N0 0 i.succ) n x = leadingStress i n x"
